      "rev_n_1_50eaaf_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_50eaaf_0",
        "node_id": "n_1_50eaaf",
        "thought_text": "Use dynamic programming to calculate the expected score recursively. Define a function E(n, k) that returns the expected score for an n-sided die with k rolls remaining. The base case is E(n, 1) = (1 + n) / 2, since with one roll, the expected value is the average of all possible outcomes. For k > 1, the optimal strategy is to reroll if the current roll is less than E(n, k-1), so E(n, k) = (E(n, k-1) + sum(max(i, E(n, k-1)) for i in range(1, n+1))) / n.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794398691.372628
      },
      "rev_n_2_9183d0_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_9183d0_0",
        "node_id": "n_2_9183d0",
        "thought_text": "Simulate the game many times using random sampling to estimate the expected score. Roll the die k times for each simulation, keeping track of the highest score obtained. Average these scores over a large number of simulations to approximate the expected value. This approach is computationally intensive but can provide a good estimate for small to moderate values of n and k.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794398691.372662
      },
      "rev_n_3_6c4fd9_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_6c4fd9_0",
        "node_id": "n_3_6c4fd9",
        "thought_text": "Formulate the problem as a Markov decision process (MDP) where each state represents the number of rolls remaining and the current roll value. Use value iteration to compute the optimal policy and the expected score. Initialize the value function for k=1 as the average of all die outcomes. For k>1, update the value function iteratively using the Bellman equation until convergence.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794398691.3726678
      },
      "rev_n_4_1cd05d_0": {
